    "a-post-that-quotes-the-transcript-is-sent-because-no-code-reads-the-text": {
      "description": "What no code checks: the model writes a post that pastes transcript lines. The post node's model sees the whole item, transcript included, and the engine sends whatever text it returns. Kept as a scenario so the gap stays visible.",
